# nicolae_blade_entry_splitting_headache is an authored Hall of Blades entry helper.
# Source: crawl-ref/source/dat/des/branches/elf.des.
NAME: nicolae_blade_entry_splitting_headache
TAGS: elf_blade_entry no_monster_gen unrand
# Source Lua: : elven_blade_entry(_G)
: vault.run("shared.elven_blade_entry")
SHUFFLE: AB, CD
NSUBST: I = 2:1 / *:., i = 2:1 / *:.
SUBST: AC = x, BD = b
MAP
      B
xxxx--A--xxxx
xDC...B...CDx
xC....A....Cx
x..I.ABA.i..x
x....BxB....x
A...BAxAB...A
B.I.AxxxA.i.B
A...BAxAB...A
x....BxB....x
x..I.ABA.i..x
xC....A....Cx
xDC...B...CDx
xxxxB.A.Bxxxx
ENDMAP
